rifle that had  exceptional stats across the board  from its rate of fire inaccuracy even  from the hip  to its versatility in combat at almost  any range  the gun was a force to be reckoned with  before it eventually got patched  keep in mind battlefield is a game of  opportunity cost when you use a certain  class  you're expecting certain advantages at  the expense of others  but with the m16a3 you didn't have to  sacrifice anything  which naturally caused problems for  everyone who wasn't currently using the  rifle  [Music]  battlefield 3 has another entry on this  list with absolute overpowered and  busted weaponry  this time in the form of a 12 gauge  shotgun the usa s12  with frag rounds now a great way to get  a gun straight onto everyone's [ __ ] list  is its ease of use everyone and i mean  everyone of all skill types can grab  this thing hold down the fire button  and go to town thanks to its ridiculous  combination of damage  range and fire rate  the gun has inspired countless forms of  debate and even various parodies and  memes  and it destroys the line between kind of  feeling rewarding and arcady  which isn't a bad thing it's kind of  hilarious  and this was after the gun was already  patched so i can't even imagine how it  must have felt  in game at the time but do any basic  search online and you'll see gameplay  clips of just how broken and busted this  gun was  especially against vehicles  there's something to be said about a  weapon being broken partly because  everyone in the game decides that they  need to use it what i'm saying here is  that in battlefield 1  the hell regal 1915 factory smg was a  weapon that was very forgiving  but was quickly viewed as busted and  overpowered almost through a weird case  of community peer pressure  now if you're dying to an enemy using  the smg that's fine right  now imagine a dozen assault class  enemies are all using the hell regal  the probability of your streaks coming  to an end the hands of this smg  dramatically increases which is what  every battlefield 1 player experienced  the smg wasn't easy to access either at  first it was one of the final weapons  assault class players unlocked  and it even has some weaknesses such as  sporting a below average damage per  round stat  but thanks to its incredibly high  magazine tight spread  and incredible versatility the appeal of  this highly goal for all types of  players  became unavoidable and it's a big reason  why this gun is viewed as unbalanced  the more popular it became battlefield's  most recent title threw some love to the  medic class with an incredibly popular  smg  surprise surprise that encouraged a type  of playstyle that irritated a lot of  players  simply because of how forgiving and  busted the gun turned out to be with an  incredibly fast fire rate of over a  thousand rpm  with a potential upgrade of going even  beyond that to 1200 rpm  the common trade-off would be a small  magazine and needing to constantly  reload  however the nambu type 2a not only had a  fairly hefty magazine clip  but also had an incredibly quick reload  speed combine that with the one class  that could heal themselves faster  and you ended up facing some of the most  aggressive medics the franchise ever saw  so that's our quick list for this run  but if you felt like you've been  egregiously wronged by a particularly  broken weapon  that wasn't on this list just yet let us  know in the comments and discuss which  guns were totally busted and you never  know  you might find your nightmare gun on a  part 2 list in the future  thanks for watching  do  [Music]  do
 

